      "sequence_position": 2,
      "problem": "What function represents a stretch of factor $4$ and invariant $x$-axis, followed by a stretch of factor $3$ and invariant $y$-axis?",
      "worked_solution": "- A stretch of factor $4$ and invariant $x$-axis can be represented by the function\n\n$$\n(x,y)↦(x,4y).\n$$\n\n- A stretch of factor $3$ and invariant $y$-axis can be represented by the function\n\n$$\n(x,y)↦(3x,y).\n$$\n\nTherefore, the combination of the stretches is given by\n\n$$\n(x,y)↦(3x,4y).\n$$",
